        <briefdescription>
<para>Rollback to last known good state. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Restore plugin to the state captured by the most recent <ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1_i_self_healing_plugin_1ab8f2da2da737f9360323851302ae1b5e" kindref="member">saveCheckpoint()</ref>. This should restore:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Configuration</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Connection parameters</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Internal state</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>true if rollback was successful </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Must be thread-safe </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
